Bias distribution (bandgap -> PMOS copies -> module diodes) over PVT x resistor corner (operating point)
* Real: serdes_bias_ref copies into the module diodes (bias_dist.spice).  Ideal (the benches so far):
* 0.85 mA into nfet 20 / 0.5 nf 4, 50 uA into the CTLE LVT diode, 50 uA into vbn, 50 uA out of vbp.
* Swing proxy: a CML half circuit at full current, tail nfet 20 / 0.5 nf 4 on the bias line, drain at
* 1.0 V through a 500 Ohm load: high_po for the real bias (constant swing), ideal for the ideal bias.
.lib "@MODEL_LIBRARY@" @SECTION@
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/devices/spice/sky130_primitives.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/devices/spice/sky130_pfet_lvt.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/bias/spice/bandgap.spice"
.include "@PROJECT_ROOT@/analog/common/bias/spice/bias_dist.spice"
Vdd vdd 0 @SUPPLY@
Xref vbg i0 i1 i2 i3 vgi vdd 0 serdes_bias_ref
Xccml ocml vgi vdd serdes_bias_pcopy n=85
Xcctle octle vgi vdd serdes_bias_pcopy n=20
Xccp ocp vgi vdd serdes_bias_pcopy n=20
Vi0 i0 0 0.7
Vi1 i1 0 0.7
Vi2 i2 0 0.7
Vi3 i3 0 0.7
Vmcml ocml vcml 0
Xdcml vcml 0 serdes_bias_cml
Vmctle octle vctle 0
Xdctle vctle 0 serdes_bias_ctle
Vmcp ocp vbn 0
Xdcp vbn vbp vdd 0 serdes_bias_cp
* swing proxy, real: tail on vcml, high_po 500 Ohm (w 3, l 3.54)
Vtop top 0 1.0
Xrl top dr 0 sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po w=3 l=3.54
Xtail dr vcml 0 0 serdes_nfet w=20 l=0.5 nf=4
* ideal references
Iref vdd vbias_i 0.85m
Xdi vbias_i vbias_i 0 0 serdes_nfet w=20 l=0.5 nf=4
Rli top dri 500
Xtaili dri vbias_i 0 0 serdes_nfet w=20 l=0.5 nf=4
Ictle vdd vctle_i 50u
Xdctlei vctle_i vctle_i 0 0 serdes_nfet_lvt w=8 l=0.5 nf=4
In vdd vbn_i 50u
Xdni vbn_i vbn_i 0 0 serdes_nfet w=5 l=1
Ip vbp_i 0 50u
Xdpi vbp_i vbp_i vdd vdd serdes_pfet w=20 l=1 nf=4
.nodeset v(vbg)=1.23 v(xref.xbg.s)=1.23 v(xref.vg)=0.9 v(vgi)=0.9 v(xref.xbg.ta)=0.95 v(xref.xbg.tb)=0.95
.temp @TEMP_C@
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1p vntol=1u klu
